\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Minibatch gradient estimator}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{pretraining}
\tag{optimization}

\p{At update #{k}, let #{B_k} be a sampled minibatch of training strings. The
\newvocab{minibatch gradient estimator} is
##{
g_k=\frac1{|B_k|}\sum_{x\in B_k}\nabla_\theta
\ell(\theta_k;x).
}}

\p{Backpropagation through a Transformer and gradient-based parameter updates
are specified in \citet{sec. 7}{phuong2022formal}. Whether #{g_k} is unbiased
for a population gradient depends on the sampling and weighting scheme. The
definition does not assume that property.}
